# ABP Redis Cache

## Configuration
```json
{
  "Redis": {
    "IsEnabled": "true",
    "Configuration": "127.0.0.1:6379"
  }
}
```

## Benefits
- Implements `SetManyAsync`/`GetManyAsync` for batch operations
- Simplified configuration via `IConfiguration`

## Setup
Install `Volo.Abp.Caching.StackExchangeRedis` package (pre-installed in templates).
